@startuml state-document-record
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title SIMDP - State Diagram: DocumentRecord Lifecycle

[*] --> PENDING : Pegawai unggah dokumen\n(POST /api/v1/documents/upload)

PENDING --> APPROVED : Staf / Admin approve\n(VerificationHistory dibuat)

PENDING --> REJECTED : Staf / Admin reject\n(reviewNote wajib, VerificationHistory dibuat)

APPROVED --> EXPIRED : Cron job harian\n(expiryDate < TODAY)

REJECTED --> PENDING : Pegawai upload ulang dokumen baru\n(re-submit)

APPROVED --> REPLACED : Dokumen baru diunggah\n(DB Trigger: handle_document_replacement)\n[hanya jika allowMultiple = false]

PENDING --> REPLACED : Dokumen baru diunggah\nsaat masih pending\n[hanya jika allowMultiple = false]

note right of REPLACED
  Status terminal untuk snapshot lama.
  isCurrent = false.
  Riwayat tetap tersimpan di VerificationHistory.
end note

note right of EXPIRED
  Riwayat APPROVED sebelumnya
  tetap tersimpan di VerificationHistory.
  Pegawai perlu upload dokumen baru.
end note

EXPIRED --> [*] : Soft delete (deletedAt)\n(Admin only, bukan proses otomatis)
REPLACED --> [*] : Soft delete
REJECTED --> [*] : Soft delete

@enduml
